# CatDex — Expo 54

## Docs pin

Expo **has changed**. Before using APIs, read:

https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v54.0.0/

Do not assume Expo 49/50 habits (Router, AV, FileSystem, Camera).

## App entry

- `expo-router` file-based routes under `app/`
- Root layout: fonts, providers, auth bootstrap — `app/_layout.tsx`
- Scheme / slug: `catdex` (`app.json`)

## Common modules in use

| Concern | Package / area |
|---------|----------------|
| Camera | `expo-camera` + scanner screen |
| Haptics | `expo-haptics` via `gameFeedback` |
| Audio hooks | `expo-av` (prefs-gated; assets optional) |
| Files / photos | `expo-file-system`, photo URI helpers |
| Secure storage-ish | AsyncStorage for session/persist |
| Blur / gradients | `expo-blur`, `expo-linear-gradient` |

## Env

Client public env must be `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` (Supabase URL/anon, API URL, auth provider flags). Rebuild/reload after env changes.

## Web

- Map uses MapLibre path; test layout on web when touching map/HUD
- Some native modules no-op on web (haptics) — keep UX intact without them
